# Prose sugars [id: "sugars", class: "demo"]

The 2026-08 surface: ~~struck~~ text, a [link *with markup*](https://example.com/a_b),
and an image ![An owl](sample.svg) inline. /* a nested /* block */ comment */ Escapes:
\// stays literal slashes, \~~ stays tildes, \[not: attrs].

Smart-punct material — "quotes", 'singles', it's 5 -- or 6 --- dots... — is transformed
at the decode stage, so `"code" -- ...` and $a -- b$ stay raw.

